## 🛠️🖥️ PHASE 4 — WAZUH SERVER INSTALLATION

### 📍🔎 WHERE TO RUN

**Run all installation commands on the Wazuh Server.**

### 1️⃣ UPDATE UBUNTU

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt upgrade -y
sudo hostnamectl set-hostname wazuh-server
```

### 2️⃣📥 DOWNLOAD INSTALLATION ASSISTANT

